:PATH
L. Repeal of federal private law
|

:INFO
Art. 18
On the entry into force of this Act, the federal private law provisions that are inconsistent herewith, and in particular, the Third Division of the Code of Obligations entitled "Commercial Enterprises, Securities and Business Names" (Federal Act of 14 June 1881 on the Code of Obligations, Art. 552–715 and 720–880) are repealed.
|

:NOTE
[AS 5 635, 11 490; BS 2 784 Art. 103 para. 1. BS 2 3 Final Title Art. 60 para. 2]

:PATH
M. Commencement of this Act
|

:INFO
Art. 19
1 This Act comes into force on 1 July 1937. 2 Excepted from the foregoing is the Section on the community of bond creditors (Art. 1157–1182), the commencement date for which will be determined by the Federal Council. 3 The Federal Council is responsible for the implementation of this Act.
|

